                "value": 0.7964
              },
              "free_text": [
                " 18.4 ng of Cf sample resulted",
                "in a 9000 fission per second count rate with 99.7%",
                "being from the spontaneous fission of 252Cf."
              ]
            }
          ],
          "DETECTOR": [
            {
              "pointer": "",
              "coded_information": [
                "FISCH"
              ],
              "free_text": [
                " 252Cf fission chamber was designed and",
                "fabricated containing 18.4 ng of Cf. This fission",
                "chamber was used to compare the spectrum obtained",
                "with the fission chamber signal to that from the",
                "gamma tagging method and was shown that both spectra",
                "show good agreement validating the gamma tagging method"
              ]
            },
            {
              "pointer": "",
              "coded_information": [
                "BAF2"
              ],
              "free_text": [
                " Four BaF2 gamma detectors were used to detect",
                "gamma rays. BaF2 gamma detectors are hexagonal prisms",
                "measuring 5 inches long and 2 inches across. The face",
                "of each detector was located 10 cm from the center of",
                "the fission sample in a square configuration with the",
                "detector centers located 10 inches apart."
              ]
            }
          ],
          "METHOD": [
            {
              "pointer": "",
              "coded_information": [
                "TOF"
              ],
              "free_text": [
                " Neutron energy spectra were measured by time-of-",
                "flight using gamma ray tagging with BaF2 start",
                "detectors. Coincidence of two out of four BaF2",
                "detectors was required with a timing window of 3 ns",
                "between the events."
              ]
            },
            {
              "pointer": "",
              "coded_information": [
                "PSD"
              ],
              "free_text": [
                " Pulse shape discrimination was used to reduce",
                "gamma ray background in neutron detectors"
              ]
            }
          ],
